---
import SMSLayout from '../../layouts/JenkinsSMSLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig, hasPhone } from '../../config/site';
---
<SMSLayout title="SMS Terms & Conditions" description="Cloud9 SaaS text messaging terms, message frequency, opt-out and support instructions." canonicalPath="/terms/" noindex={true}>
<p class="overline">{siteConfig.businessName} • Messaging Terms</p>
<h1>SMS Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
<p class="muted">Last updated November 23, 2026</p>

<h2>Program description</h2>
<p><strong>{siteConfig.businessName}</strong> (operated by <strong>{siteConfig.legalEntityName}</strong>, {siteConfig.registeredAddress}) operates an optional SMS/MMS messaging program via SignalWire. On our <a href="/sms">SMS Opt-In form</a> or <a href="/contact">Contact form</a>, you may separately check one or both optional, unchecked consent boxes:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Customer Service &amp; Transactional SMS:</strong> Support responses, order confirmations, digital product fulfillment updates, project consultation coordination, and appointment reminders.</li>
  <li><strong>Consent-Based Promotional &amp; Product Updates:</strong> Optional announcements regarding new software tools, updates, and promotional offers from {siteConfig.businessName}.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Consent is not a condition of purchasing any goods or services or submitting an inquiry.</strong></p>

<h2>Consent confirmation</h2>
<p>When you opt in to SMS and our registered carrier campaign is active, you will receive an initial confirmation text message identifying {siteConfig.businessName}, confirming your message scope, and reminding you how to request HELP or reply STOP to opt out.</p>

<h2>Message frequency and rates</h2>
<p>Message frequency varies based on your customer service requests, active orders, or appointments. Optional promotional/marketing updates are limited to no more than 4 messages per month. <strong>Message and data rates may apply.</strong> Please consult your mobile carrier regarding text and data charges.</p>

<h2>Opt-out (STOP) and re-subscribe (START)</h2>
<p>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> (or STOPALL, UNSUBSCRIBE, CANCEL, END, QUIT) to any text message at any time to opt out. You will receive one final confirmation text confirming your opt-out, and our system will immediately suppress all future SMS/MMS messages across all scopes unless you reply <strong>START</strong> or submit a new opt-in.</p>

<h2>Help and customer support</h2>
<p>Reply <strong>HELP</strong> (or INFO) to any text message for assistance, or contact customer support via our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>{hasPhone ? `, by business telephone at ${siteConfig.phone},` : ''} or by email at <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.supportEmail}`}>{siteConfig.supportEmail}</a>.</p>

<h2>Carrier liability disclaimer</h2>
<p>Wireless carriers (including AT&amp;T, T-Mobile, Verizon, and participating regional carriers) are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>

<h2>Privacy</h2>
<p>Read our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. We never sell or share mobile numbers or SMS opt-in consent data with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</p>

<h2>General Terms of Service</h2>
<p>These SMS Terms supplement our full <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>. We may revise these terms from time to time and will update the effective date above.</p>
</SMSLayout>
